  m_text: "IT CAN SPEAK!\r\nTo CIA.giv\r\nFrom C_D.gov\r\nWe detonated the A.W.E.D
    and most of our remaining staff did not make it to the shelter in time, we heard
    speaking from the hallways, I think its MS108, it has arms growing from its fucking
    torso, we don\u2019t know what to do anym hello?\r\nhello. hello hello hel-LO?
    hello.\r\nah ah eh. wuh-ter. wuhter. wa wa wa.\r\nMAYDAY mayday mey-deh mehhh-day.
    copee. copee tha. copee that?? kkkrrsh.\r\nfissh. fish. fih. fissh fissh fissh.
    \r\nthankyew. thangk yoo. thnkyu thnkyu thnkyu nom nom. sowwy. sow-ry. sorry.
    sorrrrr\r\nuh-oh-kay?? oh-kay. ok. okkkk-ay. ok ok ok ok\r\nha ha. ah ha. haaa.
    hah. is laugh. i hear man do. is good sound\r\nboat go bzzzzt. boat go ZZzzt.
    boat go dark. dark. dhark. dahk. \r\nwan-ty. warrantee. wor-wor-warren-tee??
    waranty. waranty. WARRANTY. dont know. is nice. on the radio. before radio die\r\ntuz-day.
    tooz. tooz-dey. tuuuuz. tuz-day tuz-day tuz-day. \r\nwy fy. wai. fai. wha-fai??
    wifi?? wifi. wi. fi. fi. fi. fih?? is fish??\r\nheh-lo. hel-lo. hello Deborah.\r\npleez
    hoooold. pleeez. pleeeez hold. hold. hold. hold. HOLD. bite. hold bite. same\r\nehhh-mer-jen-see.
    eh-mer-jen. emergency emergency. wee-ooo wee-ooo wee-ooo \r\nuh. uh. uhhhh. wat.
    wa. wat.\r\nZZZT. i tuch fone. fone go bzzt. fone go dead. ded. dehhd. ha ha.
    hah. \r\nshtahp. shtop. stop. stop stop. no. no stop. nostop. zap.\r\ngud-bye.
    gud-bai. gooo. good. goodbye. bai. bai. bai bai bai\r\nbzzzzzzzzzzzt\r\n"
